{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>His daughters.</b> This is Dinah alone. And it is possible that Dinah had young female servants who were raised with her, and on account of his daughter Scripture calls them Jacob's daughters, because they grew up in his house, like \"the sons of Michal\" [2 Samuel 21:8]. And likewise \"the daughters of his sons,\" for there is only one [granddaughter]."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:06.043872214Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}